{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/e71388176ba8def1f2490386b8b4edcb.poster.avif?t=1761280009\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/e71388176ba8def1f2490386b8b4edcb.webm?t=1761280009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/e71388176ba8def1f2490386b8b4edcb.mp4?t=1761280009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR CHAMPION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fierce tacticians, burly brawlers, agile tricksters - each Champion brings unique abilities to the arena, and you\u2019re calling the shots. Of course, victory is never earned alone. Champions fight side-by-side with their teammate, forging dynamic 2v2 strategies where teamwork is everything. The right Champion doesn\u2019t just shape your deck -\u00a0 they define your legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/660cc8ad0884b8ade21a13e1dd9a9dd8.poster.avif?t=1761280009\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/660cc8ad0884b8ade21a13e1dd9a9dd8.webm?t=1761280009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/660cc8ad0884b8ade21a13e1dd9a9dd8.mp4?t=1761280009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SUMMON YOUR STRONGEST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your powerful pack of summons into the arena and watch them blaze a path to Wildcard glory. It could be a tank holding the line, a sniper striking from range, a blitzer charging in, or a shielder protecting you at the critical moment. Some arrive with explosive impact, others linger to control the fight, but anyone can shift momentum in an instant. Summons are your frontline army, your tactical weapons, and the link between your Champion\u2019s abilities and your team\u2019s victory. The way you build and deploy your deck determines the flow of battle itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/fd3cbe15919e3887c37ca40d1432c1ab.poster.avif?t=1761280009\" width=1170 height=574 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/fd3cbe15919e3887c37ca40d1432c1ab.webm?t=1761280009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/fd3cbe15919e3887c37ca40d1432c1ab.mp4?t=1761280009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMPETE IN EPIC ARENAS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into adrenaline-fueled 2v2 battles fusing high-impact action gameplay with strategic deck-building. Each match is a contest of skill and coordination where control of the fight can change in a heartbeat. Champions clash across diverse arena layouts, demanding adaptability and rewarding smart positioning, quick reactions, and team coordination. With tight third-person combat, real-time decision-making, and dynamic tactical options, every showdown is a competitive spectacle that rewards mastery, creativity, and bold plays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/55c7bde751c27c872de02aea79201251.poster.avif?t=1761280009\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/55c7bde751c27c872de02aea79201251.webm?t=1761280009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/55c7bde751c27c872de02aea79201251.mp4?t=1761280009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ASSEMBLE YOUR DECK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every card in your deck is a piece of your strategy - from resilient frontline summons to disruptive tricksters, game-changing Wildcards, and powerful Champion talents. Building the perfect deck means balancing aggression, control, and combo potential while tailoring your playstyle to every situation. Study your summons up close, explore their stats and abilities, and with each new deck build, you can stay one step ahead of your rivals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/6a068a0de18258fba2623a4984108f33.poster.avif?t=1761280009\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/6a068a0de18258fba2623a4984108f33.webm?t=1761280009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/6a068a0de18258fba2623a4984108f33.mp4?t=1761280009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BE PART OF THE ACTION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your rightful place in the Arena and prove you\u2019re the ultimate Champion. Master unique playstyles, summon powerful allies, outthink your opponents with tactical deckbuilding, and dominate the battlefield in adrenaline-fueled 2v2 combat. The path to Wildcard victory is yours to claim - are you ready to take it?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/497120?t=1761280009","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761280009","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/f3ef1685e40a6cd15b9c42d8455884d5b7a57b8a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761280009","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/f3ef1685e40a6cd15b9c42d8455884d5b7a57b8a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761280009","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/e71388176ba8def1f2490386b8b4edcb.poster.avif?t=1761280009\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/e71388176ba8def1f2490386b8b4edcb.webm?t=1761280009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497120/extras/e71388176ba8def1f2490386b8b4edcb.mp4?t=1761280009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR CHAMPION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fierce tacticians, burly brawlers, agile tricksters - each Champion brings unique abilities to the arena, and you\u2019re calling the shots. Of course, victory is never earned alone. Champions fight side-by-side with their teammate, forging dynamic 2v2 strategies 